Backport: Avoid state corruption via bailout (PHP 7.2.34)

Minimal mitigation for EOL PHP 7.2, backported from the official 7.4 fix
(commit 712e60f9, "Avoid state corruption via bailout").

Fix GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w (CVE-2026-109618)
Fix GHSA-6wmf-4rv5-p3rp (CVE-2026-109619)

Apply with: patch -p1 --forward --batch < php-7.2.patch
Adaptations vs the 7.4 reference are recorded in port-notes/72.md
(notably: the Zend/zend_types.h HT_HASH_RESET sub-hunk is dropped because
7.2's HT_HASH_RESET is already an unconditional memset; the VM concat guards
use ZEND_SIZE_MAX because 7.2 has no ZSTR_MAX_LEN; and the session rfc1867
neutralisation uses "|| 1" because 7.2 has no C99 "true" in that unit).

